[Notes.DisclaimerExpert_AbstrInv DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Mystery Foe"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Collect the four clues without being detected to discover who your target is and execute him or her.\n \nThe target is chosen randomly each time you play. \nYou can try to find who your target is without having all the clues, but if you kill an innocent, the challenge is over.\nDo NOT get spotted. If you get spotted, your target will try to escape.\n\nThe clues are placed on the belts of some characters. You'll have to pickpocket them. \n\nScoring: \n* If you kill the right person without having all the clues, you score more points.  \n* Avoiding the guards is worth more points than knocking them unconscious,  which in turn is worth more than killing them.\n\nGame Over: \nThe challenge is over if the target escapes or if you kill an innocent."

[Notes.DisclaimerExpert_Pickup DisTweaks_AbstractItemPickupNote]
m_PressKeyToReadMessage=""
m_OnPickupMessage=""

